#. locationOrName,locationOrName2
msgctxt "680544"
msgid "1st & 2nd Year Classroom"
msgstr "Salas do 1o e 2o Ano"

#. locationOrName,locationOrName2
msgctxt "680572"
msgid "3rd Year Classroom"
msgstr "Salas do 3o Ano"

#. locationOrName,locationOrName2
msgctxt "680592"
msgid "Student Council Room"
msgstr "Sala do Grêmio"

#. locationOrName,locationOrName2
msgctxt "680616"
msgid "Janitor's Closet"
msgstr "Depósito do Zelador"

#. choice
msgctxt "680636"
msgid "Don't press."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "680652"
msgid "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "680672"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680728"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680832"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680968"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681012"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681152"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681272"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681372"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681564"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681628"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681708"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681824"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681952"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681996"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682124"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682252"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682360"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682448"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682540"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682688"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682772"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682904"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683004"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683164"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683292"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683384"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683516"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683616"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683824"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683948"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684080"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684172"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684296"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684376"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684480"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684568"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "684688"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "684772"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "684852"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "684920"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "684960"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "684992"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685024"
msgid "The space we descended into was a world\ncontaining contrasting elements all blended together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685120"
msgid "It was cold, and it was warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685152"
msgid "The only sounds were of #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's obscene\nbreathing and murmurings, making this a world\ndevoid of background noise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685288"
msgid "This is the mind of an #C000246204Ego#CDEF different from #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685376"
msgid "And―――In the center of this silent and\ntranquil cocoon was a single girl bathed in toxic nectar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685476"
msgid "I've been looking forward to this moment.\nYou'll finally become my #ROFS0003#RUBSthing#RUBElove#REND, won't you,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685612"
msgid "I've been looking forward to this moment.\nYou'll finally become my #ROFS0003#RUBSthing#RUBElove#REND, won't you,\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685752"
msgid "Even when her own mind―her last bastion of defense―\nis attacked, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF retains her grace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685868"
msgid "She was born―no, her#RUBS           systems    #RUBE biological functions#REND\nwere molded that way so that she could rule."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685996"
msgid "Oh? Excited, are we?\nYou've lost your #C000246204Invincibility#CDEF, and your\nstolen levels have decreased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686104"
msgid "Now we're equal. …no, I say Praetor has a small\nedge up on you. I suppose it's your turn\nto be cornered this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686220"
msgid "Still stuck in your old ways even now, huh?\nI admire that, but it's also why I pity you.\nSometimes a bluff belies insecurity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686348"
msgid "Enough with this aloof prima donna facade.\nYou no longer have any hope of beating us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686436"
msgid "We haven't been looking forward to this AT ALL.\nWe completely erased your privileges.\nNo more of this queen charade for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686564"
msgid "You can't win, you have nowhere to run, and the\nmasses never supported you to begin with―――\nNow! It's time to face the consequences!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686700"
msgid "So, despite losing everything, your pride has\nyet to budge. Good. You'll make for an opponent\nworth toying with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686816"
msgid "Heh―――You do have a point there.\nYou're correct, Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686880"
msgid "Heh―――You do have a point there.\nYou're correct, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686956"
msgid "I'm a poisonous bee with clipped wings. The\npower I once wielded was fleeting and now gone,\nand I can't bear to see my weakened body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687092"
msgid "I have poisons I can attack with only because of\nthese circumstances. Know what's going on\noutside? …hee hee. Let me give you a peek."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687228"
msgid "―――Hold on a second.\nThe old school building's controls are starting\nto melt from the edges…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687328"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF, check for viruses!\nWe'll quickly find where it's coming from…\n…no way! It's originating from in HERE!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687456"
msgid "That's no―this is no… virus…!\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF went, through the President,\nand into, me―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687568"
msgid "No… She's using this method,\nto assimilate, me―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687624"
msgid "I can hear #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's screams."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687672"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF temporarily opened a circuit to the outside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687744"
msgid "How shortsighted of you, #C236196003White Sakura#CDEF. I'm not\nlike #C236196003Lip#CDEF or the #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF. I am shapeless water;\na nectar that permeates anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687924"
msgid "When you peer into my mind, \nyou simultaneously expose yours to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687992"
msgid "I'm going to take that defenseless \"mind\" of\nyours and transform it into a carbon copy of me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688088"
msgid "This can't be happening…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688116"
msgid "It's not that we followed #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF into this place;\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF tempted us inside―so that she could make\ndirect contact with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688300"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, please cut off #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's\nconnection to the Labyrinth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688400"
msgid "Hee hee. What nice screams you make, original.\nVery satisfying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688464"
msgid "How it does feel to be melting?\nLike turning into a sweet nectar and\nbecoming paralyzed, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688560"
msgid "―――I'm the only ruler of the Moon needed\naround here. I'll melt down #C236196003BB#CDEF later, so don't\nworry. Take your turn first and sink away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688712"
msgid "This is the second time.\nWhy is #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF so persistent on targeting #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688824"
msgid "However, I'm different.\nI came from #C236196003BB#CDEF, but I'm not #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688912"
msgid "I won't accept a fate where I disappear.\nI'm not a tool; I'll become everything.\nI'll pass on being \"one of them.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689028"
msgid "Moreover―――\nI'm going to make you mine, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689096"
msgid "Moreover―――\nI'm going to place you by my side, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689172"
msgid "All my giving love. All my wanting love. All of\nme! This is no #C000246204Ego#CDEF detached from #C236196003BB#CDEF; this\nis my―this is the sound mind born from me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689340"
msgid "I won't let anyone reject me.\nEspecially not you, absolutely not.\nI'd rather you kill me than reject me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689448"
msgid "Now. Be taken in, you wretch.\nWithin my arms, I will show you a\nnever-ending, eternal dream…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689544"
msgid "Her massive love attempts to take in\nher target and quarantine them away from foreign enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689640"
msgid "But for the person being desired,\nit's an obsession that's hard to come to terms with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689728"
msgid "This #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, who stands before our\neyes in the form of a beautiful woman―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689824"
msgid "…is the embodiment of a torrent of water\ntaking in this entire space, even at this very moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689924"
msgid "Here she comes, Praetor!\nIt's time to answer that twisted love with\nblade in hand!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690008"
msgid "That's a nightmare you're talking about,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. Let's do this, Master.\nBe the one to send her off!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690128"
msgid "The same poles on magnets can only repel,\nand I already have a Master I must protect.\nYour wish will never come true―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690252"
msgid "You're the wretched one here!\nAnd you're not smart, you're nothing!\nDon't talk when you're flat as a stone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690360"
msgid "That's where you're mistaken, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nYou were foolish enough to seek eternity, and\nnow you'll be sent off by my hand!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690500"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's long hair flows out like blue\nstreaks of shooting stars.\nThe very space around us closes in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690624"
msgid "―――The #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF of pleasure, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690704"
msgid "It's finally time to settle this…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690740"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is falling apart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690788"
msgid "…unlike the others, defeat means something\ndifferent for her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690852"
msgid "After the others were defeated,\nthey would become powerless.\nBut not for her.\nTo her, defeat meant death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690960"
msgid "\"If I'm rejected, then I have no choice but to die.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691016"
msgid "Praetor. This will be your last dialogue with\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. What you do with #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nmind――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691148"
msgid "I leave it to you to decide whether to\nridicule spike-girl's mind or forgive it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691232"
msgid "You're up, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Will you use the secrets \nyou've obtained to merrily fool around with her,\nor will you show respect to a newborn mind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691388"
msgid "Regardless, her life cannot be saved.\nDo as you please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691444"
msgid "This is my first and last chance to expose #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "691524"
msgid "Use Melt's SG to corner her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691556"
msgid "I'll use #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF to corner her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691628"
msgid "It's not that I want revenge for all the\npain she put us through… but I got a few things to say to her.\nI won't be satisfied otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691768"
msgid "Unless I lay #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind bare,\nwe can't get out of #ROFS0004#RUBS    mental space#RUBEthis place#REND, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691904"
msgid "I need to get tough and press #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF\nto reflect on her actions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691988"
msgid "You're here… I made two confessions and\ngot rejected twice. Finally, you want to break\nmy pride, too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692092"
msgid "…well, this is your usual method, right?\nKicking your opponent while they're down.\nI would do the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692200"
msgid "I'm going to use all the strength\nI have left to find out―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692268"
msgid "She put her life on the line for her love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692312"
msgid "That's enough to tell what's going on in #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind.\nExplaining it would do her no justice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692428"
msgid "I didn't want to hurt her pride any more than I already have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692492"
msgid "Ah….――― The#RUBS  sea#RUBE sky#REND is… so dark.\nYeah… I never did reach you, did I…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692588"
msgid "Ahh… my arms, legs… body… chest, all hurts.\n…hee hee. Maybe this is what a broken heart\nfeels like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692692"
msgid "In the end… I couldn't get what I wanted.\nHey, #C236196003Lip#CDEF, you dummy. For what purpose\nwere we born, do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692820"
msgid "There's no hatred in #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692880"
msgid "She still looked bitter and full of venom,\nbut at the same time, she looked fully resolute."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692972"
msgid "…don't worry, Master.\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF has no more strength left\nto fight with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693064"
msgid "Hmph! Still want some more!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693096"
msgid "Her sleeves are soaked in blue nectar.\nSummoning the very last of her strength,\nshe puts out her decaying arm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693208"
msgid "Hee hee―――Of, course―――\nThis is what I deserve―――\nAn ending, where I'm all alone―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693304"
msgid "She had a seemingly sad / seemingly satisfied smile\non her face in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693380"
msgid "Unable to have realized her love / unable to have taken in the\none she loved―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693460"
msgid "She thought about how truly glad she was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693504"
msgid "Those were #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's final moments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693560"
msgid "To put it less flowery, I think it was a cruel death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693616"
msgid "…farewell, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nYour love was far too closed off,\nyet your passion was much like the ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693732"
msgid "You were as evil as they come, but―――\nYour unwavering conviction was admirable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693816"
msgid "She was an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF. #C000246204Egos#CDEF and decency are\nmutually exclusive… This relationship was\nincomprehensible. Someone had to disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693980"
msgid "…if she had been as dim as #C236196003Lip#CDEF was,\nI bet she could've been saved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694064"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are an immutable selfishness;\nprojected personalities that cannot change, even\nif they know being as they are hurts others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694216"
msgid "…well, she had pride, I'll give her that. She\nnever did touch on that contradiction, since she\nwas playing queen up until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694356"
msgid "All that power she consumed, but in truth,\nshe never got any closer to satisfaction. Such\nwere the results of your desires, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694508"
msgid "Without ever becoming a woman, you disappeared\nas a little girl. I'll carry the memory\nof your miserable wish with me forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694636"
msgid "…my consciousness is being forcefully risen up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694688"
msgid "With my body freed from #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's gravity――\nfrom the force field of her mind,\nI quickly and silently float upwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694828"
msgid "Once we're out, the deepest part of the Labyrinth\nleading to the Core awaits us.\nThere's still no report of #C236196003BB#CDEF having broken through\nthe barrier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694992"
msgid "We should be able to make it with time to spare―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695048"
msgid "…I don't give #C236196003#SVT#CDEF the command to strike her down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695116"
msgid "Was it because I trusted #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF?\nWas it because I pitied #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695224"
msgid "I'm not sure which.\nAll I know is, the deepest part of my heart yelled\nout that \"I can't do that.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695324"
msgid "She's about to touch me.\nA little further and she'll touch my skin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695392"
msgid "While she disintegrates, in her prolonged final moments\nshe's just about to reach what she desires―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695500"
msgid "She can no longer escape destruction.\nEven if we don't finish her off,\nher fate is to disappear within a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695620"
msgid "Hurry. After beating me,\nwouldn't you just hate to lose\nbecause you ran out of time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695708"
msgid "…good point.\nPraetor, let's make haste.\nAnd farewell, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695792"
msgid "I appreciate the advice, but….\nAre you okay with this, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF?\nThat was your last chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695904"
msgid "I used up my last chance long ago.\nI even proposed twice. Doing so a third time\nwould just be coercion at that point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696024"
msgid "…we'll keep moving forward, regardless.\nI don't get it, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nWhy did you back off?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696132"
msgid "Then we'll take our leave. I won't feel bad\nwhen I forget about you, but, are you in\nneed of a beheading to ease the pain?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696256"
msgid "I'll give you a good deal and make it quick,\nif you'd like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696316"
msgid "I see. On Earth, there are flowers that bloom\nwhen bathed in moonlight, that fall when the\nsun rises."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696420"
msgid "I take offense with how your love manifests,\nbut the way you fought was a thing of beauty.\nIf fate wills it, come and face me again!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696556"
msgid "I'll pass on that, you odious woman.\nUse that lousy body of yours to protect\nyour Master as hard as you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696668"
msgid "…and here I thought the first time was\nplenty coercive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696728"
msgid "…hmph. So you can't understand a\nwoman's heart? No wonder you're traveling\nas two guys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696820"
msgid "Huh? Now I just feel disillusioned. At the most \ncritical moment, you can't understand a woman's\nheart? You're not much of a chivalrous knight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696964"
msgid "I couldn't care any less about you two at this\npoint. Still, I just couldn't ignore how your\nMaster was able to grin and bear all this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697100"
msgid "Just get out of here.\nI've had enough of you.\nI never want to see your face again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697184"
msgid "I don't need such a thing.\nWhat would you even behead me with? A mirror?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697260"
msgid "I'd prefer that you don't touch any part of my\nskin with a blunt weapon like that.\nI might catch your wrinkles, old lady."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697384"
msgid "Ahahahahaha! Alright, I'll make it a smashing\ninstead. No cutting―I'll pulverize you from\nyour skull to your neck bones!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697508"
msgid "Oh, how scary. You sure, though?\nThat Darling you love to talk about\nwill be rather put off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697604"
msgid "Grr… Should've expected as much from\na yandere like me. Awful 'til the very end!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697688"
msgid "Flowers that fall unnoticed by anyone,\npicked up by no one.\nThat's exactly what you are, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697808"
msgid "What's your deal, getting all poetic? You're a\nnasty man that always gets to the crux of\nthings. You don't have any friends, do you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697944"
msgid "Of course. One cannot have one's way AND make\nfriends. When one is unyielding, it's harder to\nmake friends than it even is to find love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698084"
msgid "However, you still have many faults.\nLooking back, you had one or two friends, no?\nBe moderate with that doll hobby of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698212"
msgid "Hmph. None of your concern. And I don't need to\nhear it from a treasure hoarder.\nYour gold is starting to blind me. Get lost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698340"
msgid "Nodding to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's words,\nI turn my consciousness to the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698436"
msgid "With my body freed from #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's gravity――\nfrom the force field of her mind,\nI quickly and silently float upwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698576"
msgid "Whatever you do―――\nOnce you learn the truth that awaits you,\ndon't give in to despair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698668"
msgid "―――Hey.\nIt's not like me to just\ndisappear all admirably."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698732"
msgid "This body will only last three more minutes,\nbut I can do anything in those three minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698824"
msgid "…though the thought disgusts me, knowing those\noperator girls, they might be able to\nget some use out of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698936"
msgid "Better to be of some use to them\nthan just fade away―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698996"
msgid "Oh, no.\nThat wouldn't be like you at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699040"
msgid "First of all…\nWhy would I allow you to take on such a role?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699104"
msgid "No way, my pseudo-Spiritrons―――\nThey're unraveling into particles…!\nThis technique is…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699200"
msgid "You intended to do the melting,\nbut you got melted, instead.\nThis is the punishment you get."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699296"
msgid "Pitiful #C000246204Ego#CDEF; a form of love unsaved. Hee hee\nhee―――That's delightful, as well. At least\ngo peacefully in the palm of my hand, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699448"
msgid "The nectar which spews forth dissolves #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's\nbody from the inside.\nThe only parts left―experience and skills―are\noffered to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699620"
msgid "That's #C000246204All Drain#CDEF… the illegal skill permitted\nonly to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, the #C000246204Ego#CDEF of pleasure―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699764"
msgid "…but it's too late.\nWe've lost all hope of victory,\nand my magical energy is depleted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699852"
msgid "I have no more magical energy to send to #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nAt this rate, I'm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699944"
msgid "Yes, it's over for you.\nStill, I'll be gentle as I put you to sleep.\nA token of my thanks, for bringing him to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700060"
msgid "The nectar which spews forth dissolves me from the inside.\nThe only parts left―my experience and skills―\nare offered to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700212"
msgid "This is #C000246204All Drain#CDEF… the illegal skill\npermitted only to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, the #C000246204Ego#CDEF of pleasure―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700356"
msgid "Hee hee. Delicious. What wonderful Spiritrons\nyou were made of, Servant. Curse your own\ninexperience as you exist within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700484"
msgid "Now―――time for the main dish, our long-\nawaited first night together, my beloved. My\nheart is beating. I could die happy right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700620"
msgid "Now―――time for the main dish, our long-\nawaited first night together, my beloved. My\nheart is beating. I could die happy right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700756"
msgid "Are you ready? Any requests? Tell me―――\nhow painful, how lightly do you want to be\nmelted down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700856"
msgid "…following #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's destruction,\n  my vitality and magical energy drain from my entire body.\n  I can't even lift my head up anymore.\n  At this rate, I'm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701032"
msgid "Are you ready? Any requests? Tell me―――\nhow painful, how lightly do you want to be\nmelted down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701132"
msgid "Haaa―――ahhh―――\nI can't get enough of this. So warm. This is\nsomething I always, always wanted to do――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701244"
msgid "Now I'm going to protect you.\nI won't let #C236196003BB#CDEF get in our way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701324"
msgid "All I have is you. All you have is me.\nI'll melt the entire world to death and offer\nit to you, my beloved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701432"
msgid "When you wake up, when you see your brand\nnew body in a brand new world, please let out\na consummate cry for me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701552"
msgid "Haaa―――ahhh―――\nI can't get enough of this. So warm.\nSo this is what love feels like―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701648"
msgid "All I have is you. All you have is me.\nI'll melt the entire world to death and offer\nit to you, my beloved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701756"
msgid "…my consciousness is fading.\n  My limbs are dissolving.\n  #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is absorbing just about every part of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701884"
msgid "I, reduced to a mere object and no longer\ncapable of even dying, will continue hearing\nwhispers of a one-sided love―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702008"
msgid "…there's nothing I can do for you now…\n  Unlike #C236196003Leo#CDEF, I can't even release you―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702112"
msgid "What's the matter? Come quickly now.\nAren't you going to strip my mind naked?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702192"
msgid "In contrast to her feeble limbs and fading body,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF glares straight up at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702296"
msgid "The pitiful contrast of this sight makes me\ninadvertently look away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702368"
msgid "Your posture is so defensive, how odd…\nYou have me cornered, and yet you fear\nthis sight of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702468"
msgid "Hard to believe you can't look someone straight\nin the face after wounding them. How cowardly\ncan you get? Or perhaps you're being kind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702608"
msgid "…hee hee. Either way, that look of yours\nmakes you worth trampling on.\nThat pained expression is so delightful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702724"
msgid "She smiles enthusiastically.\nIt almost seems as if she's happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702788"
msgid "To her, even the fact that she's lost her strength\nis nothing more than ammo to injure me with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702884"
msgid "She looks like a sweet, young girl,\nbut her disposition says otherwise.\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF has displayed this trait of hers countless times:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "703036"
msgid "Sadistic Constitution"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "703060"
msgid "Maternal Love"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703076"
msgid "I haven't a shred of maternal love in me.\nSuch foolishness brings even the closest\nrelationship to its knees, you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703196"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's love accepts all,\nwhich certainly is similar to maternal love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703288"
msgid "However, she's no mother.\nIn one respect, her love is far from one of \"warmth.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703368"
msgid "…so, this is where you expose my secrets. It's\nlike a shock through my very bone marrow; more\neffective than some barbaric Servant's attack."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703512"
msgid "Yes, that's right. I'm a deviant that can only\nget excitement from tormenting humans.\nWhat about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703616"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF boasts triumphantly as her face contorts in pain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703696"
msgid "Like a cat toying with a mouse.\nLike a child toying with an insect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703764"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF says that she offers her everything,\nwhen in fact, she still holds on tightly to her\ndomineering side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703896"
msgid "A love like that will never form an equal relationship."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703952"
msgid "Hee, hee hee hee…\nEqual?\nAhaha… You sure say some funny things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704020"
msgid "A love in exchange for fulfilling something.\nA love in exchange for accepting love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704104"
msgid "My love is fairer than such botched love,\nseeping with self-interest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704176"
msgid "To give everything and dominate―――\nGet it through your head, such love also exists."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704264"
msgid "I melt everything and turn everything in to\nmyself. So no matter what my lover does or\ndoesn't do, my love doesn't change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704388"
msgid "A love that asks for nothing.\nA love that never changes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704448"
msgid "I might not remember my own self, but still,\nin the time I've spent in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF alone,\nI've felt myself change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704592"
msgid "Maybe there is such a thing as eternal love.\nBut there's no such thing as a love that never changes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704696"
msgid "If there were such a thing, it would be her―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "704748"
msgid "Love for dolls"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "704764"
msgid "Narcissism"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704776"
msgid "Narcissism? Doesn't everyone have some in them? \nThere isn't one creature in this world\nthat doesn't love itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704892"
msgid "Self-preservation is instinctual, after all.\nCould it be that you're not just foolish,\nbut also lack insight?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705004"
msgid "Sure, it's natural to have some narcissism.\nSuch a thing doesn't make for an #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705104"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's hidden nature;\nher abnormal bias in all matters is her―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705196"
msgid "Without consideration for a person's personality,\nshe unilaterally dotes over their form and state."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705296"
msgid "Making something in the shape of another person\nspeak your own words; projecting into it your own will;\nwhispering to it your own love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705432"
msgid "Having given up on receiving love,\nit's the one-man show of a sad, young girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705512"
msgid "Still, what's the issue with that? Even if my\nlover were a doll, I would become the very world\nitself for the benefit of my lover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705644"
msgid "There's no substitute for the reassurance\nof being loved by #RUBS  everything#RUBEthe world#REND.\nDon't scorn the happiness I give."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705776"
msgid "You're my pitiful, cute doll.\nMy one and only collection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705836"
msgid "It seems both logical and not; circular thinking.\nIt's an abnormal love that speaks on the\npremise of the overwhelming difference in positions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705980"
msgid "…yeah. She's the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF that melts everything\nand makes it all one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706068"
msgid "She doesn't want anyone's opinions or love.\nShe's a prima donna ever dancing on a lonely stage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706164"
msgid "That's who this young girl, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706224"
msgid "That's right.\nSo you've finally come around to me,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706300"
msgid "That's right.\nSo you've finally come around to me,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706376"
msgid "Then hand him over to me. Using enough of my\n#RUBS  love#RUBEnectar#REND to drown him, I'll end this world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706484"
msgid "…ahh, I understand.\nI fully understand that this is the way she was created."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706564"
msgid "Maybe this is due to her pride as an AI, a non-human.\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is conflating her abilities with the\nlove she acquired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706704"
msgid "Her third #C000246204SG#CDEF is a red-herring.\nEven if I point it out, it won't shatter #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706828"
msgid "If I want to destroy her mind, destroy that love of hers,\nI need to bring up this one point. \nThe skill we can consider to be the source of\nall this is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706988"
msgid "I admit that I like my ballet…\nIn fact, I'm happy that you've pointed it out,\nbut… that's not the answer here, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707108"
msgid "Don't disappoint me too much. Act too much a\nfool and I'm liable to shrink you down to a\nnano-sized virus, like I did #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707252"
msgid "It's a skill that absorbs everything to develop.\nShe's under the illusion that such a way of being\nwas \"the form of her love.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707380"
msgid "She self-defeatingly figures that this is\nthe only way for her to acquire love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707460"
msgid "…even though she understands that her lover will\nnever love her if she uses this method."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707552"
msgid "Even when everything becomes one,\nwell, even IF everything were to become one,\nthat would come out to simply \"1.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707668"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF can't even maintain a one-on-one relationship."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707744"
msgid "So―――\nThere's nothing wrong here.\nI won't let my lover feel lonely, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707824"
msgid "She's just like #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\nThinking about it now, the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF have been\nyelling about loneliness this entire time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707976"
msgid "…so now, I'll put my personal feelings aside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708024"
msgid "With my eyes fixed on their anguish,\nI expose their minds and crush them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708100"
msgid "The young girl possessing the power to melt down everything\nand turn it into herself, who ended up falling in\nlove with someone other than herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708248"
msgid "―――Why so smug?\nDo you feel satisfied when you point out the\nobvious? Are you that much of an imbecile?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708356"
msgid "Well, more importantly, I can't let that\ncomment slip by.\n\"Just a\"? What do you mean, \"just a\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708452"
msgid "I may have a mania,\nbut I'm a SUPER doll maniac!\nCorrect your statement. Now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708532"
msgid "Otherwise, I'll use that body of yours to\nprove just how obsessed I can be.\nNow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708616"
msgid "I-I took quite some damage from that insane response…\nNo surprise, coming from the avatar of pride: #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nEven when on the verge of death, she holds\nsteadfast to the pride in her mania."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708828"
msgid "\"…sorry,\" I apologize, then pull myself together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708880"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF possesses the power to melt down everything\nand turn it into herself, and ended up falling in love\nwith someone other than herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709040"
msgid "………heh.\nHee hee, ahaha… What are you even saying?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709096"
msgid "I'm an AI. Don't call me a little girl.\nI'm one-of-a-kind and custom made; the Moon's\nruler, and nothing like #C236196003BB#CDEF or #C236196003Lip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709252"
msgid "It would be better if annoying people…\nIf people who get in my way were just gone.\n…I should just make everyone like myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709380"
msgid "If I'm going to grieve over there being no one\nelse, then I should just have their power.\n…I should absorb their power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709504"
msgid "The data shows there are wide varieties. If I'm\nstill lonely after that―――Then I should\njust have a doll I can hold tight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709632"
msgid "…it's a little hard to listen to this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709672"
msgid "She probably knew this fact the entire time\nand tried her best to keep hiding it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709756"
msgid "Writhing in pain now, she no longer resembles a ruler."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709812"
msgid "While enduring the pain in her chest,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF vaguely speaks to herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709904"
msgid "This young girl, who has trouble getting along with others,\nsaw a lonely dream where she could live on,\neven if all alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710028"
msgid "You're wrong, you're wrong…\nI don't need others,\nbecause I'm complete now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710104"
msgid "…too bad.\nThat's not the case, fool. There are plenty\nof voices I want to listen to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710192"
msgid "My lover's cries, my lover's grief,\nmy lover's despair. I get enjoyment from\npointless, adorable screams."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710300"
msgid "Although twisted, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF has \"love\" within her.\nShe fully listens to what her lover says.\nIt's just that she doesn't take them into account."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710464"
msgid "The reason she doesn't deem her lover's words\nnecessary is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710532"
msgid "Will my… will my, love, not be requited?\nI want to hear it from you―――no one else.\nYou deal me the final blow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710648"
msgid "…as if tempting her lover,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF asks one final question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710728"
msgid "There's only one thing I need to tell her.\nThat's―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710784"
msgid "…I get tough and lay it on her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710820"
msgid "There's nothing #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF can do.\nShe's a foolish woman who doesn't consider others,\nsteals from others, and is all about just herself.\nNo, she's not even a woman, she's an AI.\nWhat can an AI's love accomplish!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711052"
msgid "…the first thing I felt was the warmth of my abdomen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711108"
msgid "Then suddenly, a dull pain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711136"
msgid "Then my vision went dark…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711164"
msgid "Even if I melt everything,\neven if I make everything into me,\nI'm lightweight. I'm thin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711256"
msgid "Sure, you have a point.\nAfter all,\nI've been keeping you around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711324"
msgid "With you around, my weight will be measured.\nMy love will be measured."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711396"
msgid "In that case… Why don't we just have\nyou turn into me, too?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711460"
msgid "I feel the sensation of nectar being poured into me.\nThe sweet, numbing, annihilating taste of death…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711564"
msgid "Why didn't I just do this from the very start?\nYes, now everything is perfect.\nNow everything is complete."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711672"
msgid "Until the day the end of #RUBS everything#RUBEme#REND comes,\nyour love and life and mind and soul will be\nconstant, as if everything were dead…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711820"
msgid "Now, come to me.\nI'll melt you and melt you into me.\nThe world will be filled with#ROFS0003#RUBS nectar#RUBE love#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711940"
msgid "Good night, my adorable little doll.\nIt's okay if you never wake up again.\nFall asleep within #RUBS     everything    #RUBEme#REND―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712080"
msgid "Now both my body and mind are in tatters.\nI can't bear being in such a pitiful state,\nso I'll just quietly disappear now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712204"
msgid "But―――\nBefore that, may you tell me something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712256"
msgid "I mean, she was wrong from the beginning.\nMelting everything as she gives her everything―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712352"
msgid "If that's the only form in which she can love,\nthen she should've never loved a \"human.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712444"
msgid "She would've been better off being in love and\nleaving it at that.\nJust like how she loves dolls, she should've treated her\nlover as an object."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712588"
msgid "Yet, because she tried to love a human in a human way,\na contradiction was born."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712672"
msgid "However, the format her love is in makes her\nincapable of making humans happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712752"
msgid "If she would've disregarded her lover's happiness\nand simply devoted herself to her own love,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF would've been invincible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712900"
msgid "The moment she yearned to fall in love as a human,\nher love broke down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712972"
msgid "…and if she's just an AI,\nthen things didn't have to turn out this way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713048"
msgid "I should've been merciless\nand gone for the kill, right…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713108"
msgid "But… yep, it is what it is.\nI mean, my heart was pounding. I wanted to\nhave many more chances to chat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713212"
msgid "Yet in the end, that was my downfall, huh…\nHee hee. I longed for a human, those that I\nloathe, and ended up acting like a human…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713344"
msgid "There really is nothing I could've done about\nit. Which is why it's natural that I should\nbe defeated so miserably―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713468"
msgid "#C080080080She leaves without any complaints in the end,\nbeing the lonely primadonna she was.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713568"
msgid "#C080080080…my consciousness is forced to surface.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713628"
msgid "#C080080080My body is freed from #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF#C080080080's gravity―――\nfrom the force of her mind. \nI silently and quickly surface.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713784"
msgid "#C080080080Once I'm out of here, only the depths of the\nLabyrinth that lead to the Core remains.\nI haven't received any reports\nof #C236196003BB#CDEF#C080080080 breaking through the barrier yet.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713984"
msgid "#C080080080We should be able to make it with plenty of time\nto spare―――!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714068"
msgid "…*sigh*. I was hoping to find out whether you\nwould finish me off or not, but that's all\nout the window now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714180"
msgid "You're in need of a reeducation. We'll start\nfrom the basics. …no, let's temper every\nnucleus in your body, one by one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714304"
msgid "…the first thing I felt was the warmth of my abdomen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714360"
msgid "Then suddenly, a dull pain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714388"
msgid "Then my vision went dark…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714416"
msgid "Now the balance of power has flipped.\nWe're inside of me. With the scales tipped,\nI can easily take you in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714524"
msgid "My education is Spartan, though. I'm going to\nthoroughly kill all your cells―the 60 trillion\nor so―and give them a fresh start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714656"
msgid "I feel the sensation of nectar being poured into me.\nThe sweet, numbing, annihilating taste of death…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714760"
msgid "…in the end, it all went as planned.\nI was so foolish. I wonder why I was\ntip-toeing around for so long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714868"
msgid "Alright, are you ready?\nI'm going to melt you down and teach\nyou a lesson for rejecting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714960"
msgid "Suffer, my adorable doll.\nI'm going to have you embark on an eternal\njourney more painful than death―――"
msgstr ""

